== Trivia ==
* [[anti:R Key|R Key]] originates from the ''Antibirth'' mod.
* This item is a reference to how holding down the R key on PC will restart a run.
* This item is very similar to [[enterthegungeon:Clone|Clone]] from ''Enter the Gungeon''. The only difference is that R Key is an activated item while Clone is a passive item that activates upon death.
* Although unobtainable in challenges, if used in the [[Backasswards]] challenge, R key will send you back to {{e|Mega Satan}}.

